1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,433
I am not a thief.

2
00:00:07,767 --> 00:00:09,733
How dare you run?!

3
00:00:09,733 --> 00:00:13,700
Are you hiding more jewels
in that bag, huh?!

4
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:16,267
Here! Check it!

5
00:00:18,667 --> 00:00:21,700
You're so mean.
You're so cruel to me.

6
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,667
Because I'm just a maid?

7
00:00:23,667 --> 00:00:26,633
I didn't steal anything!

8
00:00:26,633 --> 00:00:29,533
You can even check
my fingerprints!

9
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:33,500
Ma'am, they probably stole it!

10
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,067
They've been on my back
since forever!

11
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,567
What?!

12
00:00:37,567 --> 00:00:40,700
Are you seriously
blaming us, huh?!

13
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,500
Why would we go through
all this trouble?

14
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,800
We don't know you.

15
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:51,533
You're just some pathetic,
toilet-scrubbing nobody

16
00:00:51,533 --> 00:00:53,733
playing dress up!

17
00:00:53,733 --> 00:00:55,700
[BRENDA LAUGHING]

18
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:58,400
And that dress needs
a few more cuts.

19
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,733
[KATY] Ma'am! Ma'am Brenda!

20
00:01:01,733 --> 00:01:03,167
Guards!

21
00:01:03,167 --> 00:01:05,100
[KATY] Ma'am, no. No!

22
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:06,667
- Ma'am! No!
- No! Ma'am, no!

23
00:01:06,667 --> 00:01:08,233
No, ma'am! [CRIES]

24
00:01:08,267 --> 00:01:10,300
- [BRENDA LAUGHING]
- [KATY] Hannah.

25
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:11,400
Hannah!

26
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:13,767
[BRENDA] (In Korean) You bitch!

27
00:01:13,767 --> 00:01:15,833
- Ma'am, enough!
- (In Korean) You witch!

28
00:01:15,833 --> 00:01:19,667
- [BRENDA SCREAMING]
- Ma'am!

29
00:01:19,667 --> 00:01:23,167
- Ma'am, please stop!
- (In Korean) Ah! You witch!

30
00:01:23,167 --> 00:01:26,167
- Ma'am, stop!
- [BRENDA LAUGHING]

31
00:01:26,167 --> 00:01:29,033
- Stop. Enough.
- You are a thief!

32
00:01:30,067 --> 00:01:31,567
[WHIMPERS]

33
00:01:31,567 --> 00:01:32,833
[SCREAMS]

34
00:01:32,833 --> 00:01:34,367
Brenda, stop it!

35
00:01:35,367 --> 00:01:37,433
- [HANNAH CRYING]
- Stop it!

36
00:01:37,433 --> 00:01:39,633
Please stop. [CRIES]

37
00:01:39,633 --> 00:01:41,767
Enough. Please stop.

38
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:48,533
- [EMOTIONAL MUSIC PLAYING]
- [SOBBING]

39
00:01:51,633 --> 00:01:54,533
Whatever was lost or stolen,

40
00:01:54,533 --> 00:01:56,367
I will pay for all of it.

41
00:01:56,367 --> 00:02:02,467
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC CONTINUES]

42
00:02:02,467 --> 00:02:05,367
Uh... Sorry,
filming isn't allowed here.

43
00:02:05,367 --> 00:02:08,667
Guards! Katy, get back to work.

44
00:02:08,667 --> 00:02:11,100
Um, I hope you can just...

45
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:13,267
- ...keep it to yourselves.
- Shh.

46
00:02:13,267 --> 00:02:15,533
(In Korean) Why are you
protecting this trash, Daniel?!

47
00:02:15,567 --> 00:02:17,333
Who is she?!

48
00:02:19,867 --> 00:02:22,600
I'm sorry, Madam.

49
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,733
I can't tell you.

50
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:31,267
Come back here!

51
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:34,433
I'm your boss' wife!

52
00:02:36,167 --> 00:02:37,700
You answer to me!

53
00:02:38,733 --> 00:02:40,500
It's okay.

54
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:41,833
You're safe now.

55
00:02:41,833 --> 00:02:48,667
[GENTLE MUSIC PLAYING]

56
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:55,233
[HUFFING]
